  "description": "Tailwind CSS on any Rask host, with no npm required. The build compiles your stylesheet with Tailwind's standalone binary — scanning your C# for the classes you actually wrote, arbitrary values included — and falls back to npm on the platforms Tailwind publishes no binary for, so nothing is unsupported. The version is pinned rather than floating, the download is verified against its published checksum and cached once per user, and `-p:RaskTailwindBuild=false` skips the whole thing. Depends on nothing else in Rask.",
